&lt;p&gt;Optiver is building its Digital Assets trading capabilities and is looking for a Cloud Infrastructure Engineer. This role sits in the Global Cloud Platforms team and will report to the Global Head of Cloud Platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help build the foundations for a new trading tenancy on Optiver’s existing cloud platform. With a mature hybrid cloud infrastructure already in place, this role allows you to optimize it for the unique operational and performance needs of digital assets trading. Your focus in this role will be on extending our cloud platform to meet the performance demands of a latency-sensitive, always-on trading environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be accountable for delivering a secure, performant, and robust infrastructure that directly supports trading outcomes - stability, latency, resilience, and safe change in the digital assets space.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
